@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<h2>@ViewData["Title"]</h2>

<p>Films is a comprehensive database of movies, actors, and directors.</p>
<p>Our mission is to provide a user-friendly platform for film enthusiasts to explore and learn about their favorite films.</p>

<h3>Our Story</h3>
<p>The Films application was originally created as a WebForms application and has been migrated to ASP.NET Core 8.0.</p>
<p>We continue to improve our platform to provide the best experience for our users.</p>